          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba okhwa Ulamu baba banamae be kamaani ne balasi be buyiingo. Baba ne babaana ne babechukhulu bakali, emia ndala ne kamakhumi karaano. Bano boosi baba be kholo eya Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
